{
  "title": "arVault TP2 - Pruebas y recursos de Azure",
  "description": "Correlación de Artillery y VMSS. Seleccionar una ejecución y su intervalo absoluto. Los percentiles globales se obtienen del reporte crudo. La etiqueta case describe el caso declarado, no verifica el despliegue.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "test",
      "prefix": "test",
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "case",
      "prefix": "case",
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "run",
      "prefix": "run",
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "host",
      "prefix": "host",
      "default": "*"
    },
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "default": "azure"
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "Seleccioná test, case y run para Artillery. Las métricas de ARCA y negocio usan host y env; los recursos de las VM usan host. Correlacioná todo con el mismo intervalo absoluto, sin otras pruebas simultáneas.\n\nLos percentiles HTTP del generador son por intervalo; el p95 global sale de report.json. Los percentiles de ARCA son del Agent por nodo y resultado; no son un p95 global entre nodos. ARCA aprobada no implica cambio completado. business.exchanges cuenta los intercambios que terminaron después de la aprobación de ARCA. Volumen y neto son importes por intervalo y moneda, no saldos. Sin datos no significa cero.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false,
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Solicitudes y respuestas por segundo",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "requests": [
          {
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "requests",
                "query": "sum:artillery.http.requests{$test,$case,$run}.as_rate().rollup(sum,10)"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "responses",
                "query": "sum:artillery.http.responses{$test,$case,$run}.as_rate().rollup(sum,10)"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "requests",
                "alias": "Solicitudes/s"
              },
              {
                "formula": "responses",
                "alias": "Respuestas/s"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "min": "0",
          "scale": "linear",
          "include_zero": true
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Latencia HTTP por intervalo (ms)",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "requests": [
          {
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "p50",
                "query": "avg:artillery.http.response_time.p50{$test,$case,$run}"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "p95",
                "query": "avg:artillery.http.response_time.p95{$test,$case,$run}"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "p50",
                "alias": "p50 por intervalo"
              },
              {
                "formula": "p95",
                "alias": "p95 por intervalo"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "min": "0",
          "scale": "linear",
          "include_zero": true
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Respuestas HTTP por segundo",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "requests": [
          {
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "ok",
                "query": "sum:artillery.http.codes.200{$test,$case,$run}.as_rate().rollup(sum,10)"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "client",
                "query": "sum:artillery.tp2_http_4xx{$test,$case,$run}.as_rate().rollup(sum,10)"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "server",
                "query": "sum:artillery.tp2_http_5xx{$test,$case,$run}.as_rate().rollup(sum,10)"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "ok",
                "alias": "HTTP 200/s"
              },
              {
                "formula": "client",
                "alias": "HTTP 4xx/s"
              },
              {
                "formula": "server",
                "alias": "HTTP 5xx/s"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "min": "0",
          "scale": "linear",
          "include_zero": true
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Porcentaje de respuestas HTTP 4xx y 5xx",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "requests": [
          {
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "client",
                "query": "sum:artillery.tp2_http_4xx{$test,$case,$run}.as_count().rollup(sum,10)"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "server",
                "query": "sum:artillery.tp2_http_5xx{$test,$case,$run}.as_count().rollup(sum,10)"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "responses",
                "query": "sum:artillery.http.responses{$test,$case,$run}.as_count().rollup(sum,10)"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "100 * (client + server) / responses",
                "alias": "HTTP 4xx + 5xx (%)"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "min": "0",
          "max": "100",
          "scale": "linear",
          "include_zero": true
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Resultados de cambios por segundo",
        "show_legend": true,
        "legend_layout": "auto",
        "requests": [
          {
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "approved",
                "query": "sum:artillery.tp2_exchange_ok{$test,$case,$run}.as_rate().rollup(sum,10)"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "not_approved",
                "query": "sum:artillery.tp2_exchange_not_ok{$test,$case,$run}.as_rate().rollup(sum,10)"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "pending",
                "query": "sum:artillery.tp2_exchange_pending{$test,$case,$run}.as_rate().rollup(sum,10)"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "invalid",
                "query": "sum:artillery.tp2_invalid_response{$test,$case,$run}.as_rate().rollup(sum,10)"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "approved",
                "alias": "Cambios aprobados/s"
              },
              {
                "formula": "not_approved",
                "alias": "Cambios no aprobados/s"
              },
              {
                "formula": "pending",
                "alias": "Pendientes de conciliación/s"
              },
              {
                "formula": "invalid",
                "alias": "Respuestas fuera de contrato/s"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "min": "0",
          "scale": "linear",
          "include_zero": true
        }
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Usuarios virtuales completados y fallidos por segundo",
        "show_legend": true,
